OL,3,GNEWSANo confidence vote issued to
OL,4,Ahospital leaders
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeaders overseeing a maternity
OL,7,Fcrisis-hit hospital have been issued a
OL,8,Fvote of no confidence by senior
OL,9,Fdoctors.
OL,11,FThe executive board at North Devon
OL,12,FDistrict Hospital is facing pressure
OL,13,Famid the continued suspension of its
OL,14,Fbirthing services.
OL,16,FConsultants passed the vote against the
OL,17,Fboard and said they had "no confidence"
OL,18,Fin the board's ability to ensure
OL,19,Fequitable, safe and sustainable local
OL,20,Faccess to healthcare.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
