OL,3,GNEWSANo confidence vote issued to
OL,4,Ahospital leaders
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Royal Devon
OL,7,FUniversity Hospital NHS Foundation
OL,8,FTrust, said: "We are disappointed that
OL,9,Fcolleagues have felt it necessary to
OL,10,Fdeclare a vote of no confidence, as
OL,11,Fthrough our regular discussions we have
OL,12,Fdemonstrated that we are taking their
OL,13,Fconcerns seriously."
